o take advantage,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 22.156", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; watchful, jealous master,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Aj. 945", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". mostly, lookout-man, watcher, stationed in some high place (σκοπιά) to overlook a country, esp. in war,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 2.792", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 16.365", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 3.2.1", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.1.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; hence"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ἠέλιον . . θεῶν ς. ἠδὲ καὶ ἀνδρῶν h.Cer. 62", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0013", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": also, game-watcher,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 1.6.40", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". spy, scout,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 10.324", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "526", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "561", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(later κατάσκοπος)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ς. καὶ κατοπτῆρας στρατοῦ ἔπεμψα A. Th. 36", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Tr. 956", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of a messenger who has been sent to learn tidings,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OC 35", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ph. 125", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σκοπός, ναῶν κατόπτας E. Rh. 557", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.). mark or object on which one fixes the eye,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σκοπὸν ἄλλον, ὃν οὔ πώ τις βάλεν ἀνήρ, εἴσομαι αἴ κε τύχωμι Od. 22.6", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀπὸ σκοποῦ away from the mark,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.344", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀπὸ ς. εἰρηκέναι, εἰρῆσθαι,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Tht. 179c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Smp. 2.10", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παρὰ σκοπόν Pi. O. 13.94", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; σκοπῷ ἐπέχειν τόξον to aim at it, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2.89", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σκοποῦ ἄντα τυχεῖν Id. N. 6.27", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔκυρσας ὥστε τοξότης . . σκοποῦ A. Ag. 628", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὥστε τοξόται σκοποῦ, τοξεύετ' ἀνδρὸς τοῦδε S. Ant. 1033", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄθλιον σκοπὸν ἐμοὶ ἀκοντίσας Antipho 3.3.6", "author_abbreviation": "Antipho", "tlg_author": "0028", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπὶ σκοπὸν βάλλειν X. Cyr. 1.6.29", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παραλλάξαι τοῦ ς. καὶ ἁμαρτεῖν Pl. Tht. 194a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀποτυγχάνω τοῦ σκοποῦ Id. Lg. 744a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". metaph., aim, end, object,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὗτος . . δοκεῖ ὁ ς. εἶναι πρὸς ὃν βλέποντα δεῖ ζῆν Id. Grg. 507d", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὴν ἡδονὴν ς. ὀρθὸν πᾶσι ζῴοις γεγονέναι Id. Phlb. 60a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "στοχάζεσθαι σκοποῦ Id. R. 519c", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ς. τυραννικὸς τὸ ἡδύ Arist. Pol. 1311a4", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "035", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; σκοπός . . nihil praebere 'his little game' is to make no allowance,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Cic. Att. 15.29.2", "author_abbreviation": "Cic.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. Arg."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Eq.", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Medic., of healing, ἐπὶ τῷ πρώτῳ ς. by first intention (i.e. direct union), κατὰ δεύτερον ς. by second intention (i.e. granulation or scar tissue),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Gal. 1.387", "author_abbreviation": "Gal.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "10.162", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". contest in shooting at a mark, ς. ἱππέων, πεζῶν,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IG 9(2).527.16", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "18", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(Larissa). name of a dance,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Eup. 446", "author_abbreviation": "Eup.", "tlg_author": "0461", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "."}]}